              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he showed me the river of the water of life, bright as crystal, flowing from the throne of God and of the Lamb ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.2.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gen 2.9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " through the middle of the street of the city; also, on either side of the river, the tree of life",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22.2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "the Lamb. In the midst of the street of the city, and on either side of the river, was the tree of life,",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "etc.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " with its twelve kinds of fruit, yielding its fruit each month; and the leaves of the tree were for the healing of the nations. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.14.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zech 14.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " There shall no more be anything accursed, but the throne of God and of the Lamb shall be in it, and his servants shall worship him; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.17.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ps 17.15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " they shall see his face, and his name shall be on their foreheads. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And night shall be no more; they need no light of lamp or sun, for the Lord God will be their light, and they shall reign for ever and ever.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he said to me, “These words are trustworthy and true. And the Lord, the God of the spirits of the prophets, has sent his angel to show his servants what must soon take place. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And behold, I am coming soon.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Blessed is he who keeps the words of the prophecy of this book.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I John am he who heard and saw these things. And when I heard and saw them, I fell down to worship at the feet of the angel who showed them to me; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but he said to me, “You must not do that! I am a fellow servant with you and your brethren the prophets, and with those who keep the words of this book. Worship God.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
